{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/cfb33db50af94cfea30b6fc9333a06d0.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 19th century, Canudos became a refuge for thousands. When its people defied the new Republic, they faced brutal retaliation, leaving 25,000 dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Paje\u00fa, a warrior fighting to rescue the soul of The Counselor, his fallen mentor. With each descent, time warps, and your power grows as you confront the dark forces that claimed his head and trapped his soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/3a1fb21b5ded196dfd6d3ac84d171707.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/3a1fb21b5ded196dfd6d3ac84d171707.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/3a1fb21b5ded196dfd6d3ac84d171707.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/0f4477b856a63f5cf5c43736aaa3c3ab.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second counts as you battle the undead forces of your oppressors. Risk delving deeper for powerful loot and face the nightmarish incarnations of those who sought to bury the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/9802a0d55c2aa62e673d7834eb31c268.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/9802a0d55c2aa62e673d7834eb31c268.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/9802a0d55c2aa62e673d7834eb31c268.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/9645f2351a201fa10045a478ae279a23.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down ancient Relics infused with the strength of resistance. Create devastating combinations that channel Canudos's unbreakable spirit into unstoppable power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/27dc6ef7db40dfd0c2ad52c3b7a58b9f.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/27dc6ef7db40dfd0c2ad52c3b7a58b9f.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/27dc6ef7db40dfd0c2ad52c3b7a58b9f.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/9fa0b0562bae756c32ada8be93b3fc2b.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a diverse selection of devastating abilities born from righteous fury. Dance through hordes with lightning-fast knife strikes, smash enemies with Canudos' great bell, or rain rapid-fire death from your trusty sidearm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/08607663b93e60b20bf7a012634f24e2.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/08607663b93e60b20bf7a012634f24e2.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/08607663b93e60b20bf7a012634f24e2.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c37770c7b2701e400e53b2fba9418743.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent brings new chances to right historical wrongs. Discover unique combinations of Blessings to evolve your build as you face the demons of Brazil's dark past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c7918611b1507ba08bfad48804036824.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c7918611b1507ba08bfad48804036824.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c7918611b1507ba08bfad48804036824.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/eb333a44c96a50a9ee7b2bef27cefb4f.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you seek a brutal test against history's oppressors or a thoughtful journey of justice, Hell Clock adapts to your path. Remove all time pressure with Relaxed Mode, or push your limits in Hardcore mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/973ca33a2ad06cea8e2b44dc2b0ee0ec.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/973ca33a2ad06cea8e2b44dc2b0ee0ec.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/973ca33a2ad06cea8e2b44dc2b0ee0ec.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/90b62aceb49af6eaccc8c6a335581bf0.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a complete three-act story campaign and start a new journey through our <strong>Endgame</strong> <strong>Ascension</strong> system! Climb through <strong>Hell Mode</strong>, craft challenges with Penances, and complete heavenly Promises in exchange for the godly power of the Constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/e1e250a52767f293f1081a6d4d384578.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/e1e250a52767f293f1081a6d4d384578.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/e1e250a52767f293f1081a6d4d384578.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/3212c78cddb9f458b1d84767054c78ac.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your builds to the next level by <strong>Imbuing Relics with Tools</strong> to increase their power and add new effects. Or take the risk for greater rewards by <strong>Corrupting</strong> your Relics, with equal chances for blessing or bane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/afb8df122a043f2f81399faba0d999e8.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/afb8df122a043f2f81399faba0d999e8.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/afb8df122a043f2f81399faba0d999e8.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Merchant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/72b0458e9c119ea6932af897190f57a6edf0fe1c.jpg"},{"name":"Old Companions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/240d9e9ed2ef743a17fae7b4d705495ec608276c.jpg"},{"name":"Historical Reparation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/82175c112427b2a89a2e9a569527621a14d6affb.jpg"},{"name":"Maternal Instinct","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/f662049c812b8eafb157b3ad037053e7ec211525.jpg"},{"name":"The Head-Cutter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/97614d56ada37137224d1b5e61edabbfd7c2360e.jpg"},{"name":"The Coward","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/f4c025197c41a0e840c44556987c4088b809b664.jpg"},{"name":"Back Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/53491b0cc6856f830ad7318e3040dfed95656710.jpg"},{"name":"Banquet in Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/6dd38783bb26b0d035f150286bdcd511370607da.jpg"},{"name":"Seeking Purpose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/93b4627b72ed0f157bd8b06daa88eb07cb8e1c8d.jpg"},{"name":"The Minister","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1782460/7876f809c4fa8a27aa60a13820686ac962bea7ff.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1782460?t=1770168576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770168576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/e8b0b23f43d3a1e9c1468d19d94025d0dfdc77b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770168576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/e8b0b23f43d3a1e9c1468d19d94025d0dfdc77b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770168576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Hell Clock includes depictions of intense violence and historical themes that reflect the brutal setting of the War of Canudos in Brazil, 1896. Players take on the role of a character immersed in challenging battles and face enemies in a dark, atmospheric environment that may contain scenes of explicit combat and references to social injustices of the time.\r\n\r\nWhile the game explores themes of resilience and justice, it portrays violence in a way that aligns with the historical and narrative context. There are no depictions of sexual abuse, drug or alcohol use, or other explicit sensitive topics."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/cfb33db50af94cfea30b6fc9333a06d0.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 19th century, Canudos became a refuge for thousands. When its people defied the new Republic, they faced brutal retaliation, leaving 25,000 dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Paje\u00fa, a warrior fighting to rescue the soul of The Counselor, his fallen mentor. With each descent, time warps, and your power grows as you confront the dark forces that claimed his head and trapped his soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/3a1fb21b5ded196dfd6d3ac84d171707.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c