.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c37770c7b2701e400e53b2fba9418743.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent brings new chances to right historical wrongs. Discover unique combinations of Blessings to evolve your build as you face the demons of Brazil's dark past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c7918611b1507ba08bfad48804036824.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c7918611b1507ba08bfad48804036824.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/c7918611b1507ba08bfad48804036824.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/eb333a44c96a50a9ee7b2bef27cefb4f.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you seek a brutal test against history's oppressors or a thoughtful journey of justice, Hell Clock adapts to your path. Remove all time pressure with Relaxed Mode, or push your limits in Hardcore mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/973ca33a2ad06cea8e2b44dc2b0ee0ec.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/973ca33a2ad06cea8e2b44dc2b0ee0ec.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/973ca33a2ad06cea8e2b44dc2b0ee0ec.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/90b62aceb49af6eaccc8c6a335581bf0.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a complete three-act story campaign and start a new journey through our <strong>Endgame</strong> <strong>Ascension</strong> system! Climb through <strong>Hell Mode</strong>, craft challenges with Penances, and complete heavenly Promises in exchange for the godly power of the Constellations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/e1e250a52767f293f1081a6d4d384578.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/e1e250a52767f293f1081a6d4d384578.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/e1e250a52767f293f1081a6d4d384578.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/3212c78cddb9f458b1d84767054c78ac.webp?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your builds to the next level by <strong>Imbuing Relics with Tools</strong> to increase their power and add new effects. Or take the risk for greater rewards by <strong>Corrupting</strong> your Relics, with equal chances for blessing or bane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/afb8df122a043f2f81399faba0d999e8.poster.avif?t=1770168576\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/afb8df122a043f2f81399faba0d999e8.webm?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/extras/afb8df122a043f2f81399faba0d999e8.mp4?t=1770168576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Rogue Snail"],"dlc":[3774910,3893120,3859500],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/header.jpg?t=1770168576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782460/1289182915/7198603b6ba6b773a58496bdc3386475c3e8810b/1763596393/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763839785","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782460/1289182915/7198603b6ba6b773a58496bdc3386475c3e8810b/1763596393/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763839785","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782460/1289182915/7198603b6ba6b773a58496bdc3386475c3e8810b/1763596393/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763839785","id":257234758,"name":"Hell Clock Expo Update Movement Update Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234758/e8574493bcca7712a60a7fd041502e7630583b70/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763839785"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1782460/854254/495b72d18e9b530b536251e7ae85cfe416d16492/1751030381/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742579788