gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":3082},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"22 Jul, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cIf you\u2019re looking for a beautifully dark, satisfyingly complex single-player action RPG with real stakes, set your alarms for Hell Clock.\u201d<br>ScreenRant<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s the perfect amount of risk/reward that drives all great roguelikes and dungeon crawlers. Hell Clock is an intense ride from beginning to end.\u201d<br>VICE<br><br>\u201cIt's very much a home-cooked meal to Blizzard's uncannily shapely cheeseburger; the pissy gherkin tang of applied psychology not entirely but mostly replaced by love and care and a bit of inner fire. It does not want to take over your life. It is pulpy and fiercely animated and grimly righteous. It is smart, dumb fun.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/0743087b334e48e906910ef5048f63036cfd5d5a/ss_0743087b334e48e906910ef5048f63036cfd5d5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770168576","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/0743087b334e48e906910ef5048f63036cfd5d5a/ss_0743087b334e48e906910ef5048f63036cfd5d5a.600x338.jpg?t=1770168576"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/ss_6b70449e3272cd8f439fd92c583071edb369d60c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770168576","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/ss_6b70449e3272cd8f439fd92c583071edb369d60c.600x338.jpg?t=1770168576"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/ss_7073d812feb8bb99e5666813efb6fae1e8883000.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770168576","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1782460/ss_7073d812feb8bb99e5666813efb6fae1e8883000.600x338.jpg?t=1770168576"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st